## Results

Implemented the first milestone of the `takomi` CLI entrypoint in package `takomidx` (placed in `packages/takomidx`). Updated shared contracts and `agentd` to encode hybrid attached-vs-managed workspaces and owned-vs-external runs. Scaffolded the command surface for `run`, `attach`, `status`, `open`, and `logs`.

